# Short links for print, posters and social bios.
#
# Ships to the root of dist-diwali/ and is read by Cloudflare Pages.
# 302, never 301: these are campaign links, and a browser that has
# cached a 301 cannot be told to stop.
#
# Keep them short enough to set in type and to read off a poster at
# walking pace. One line per channel, no wildcards.

/go/metro   /?utm_source=metro&utm_medium=poster      302
/go/wa      /?utm_source=whatsapp&utm_medium=message  302
/go/ig      /?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=social  302
/go/fb      /?utm_source=facebook&utm_medium=social   302
/go/qr      /?utm_source=qr&utm_medium=print          302
/go/vb      https://diwali.artindia.be/?utm_source=visitbrussels&utm_medium=listing&utm_campaign=diwali2026    302

# Per-post Instagram links live in functions/i/[n].js, not here. Pages does
# not substitute a :placeholder inside the destination's query string — it
# arrives at the box office as the literal ig-%3An — and the tag is the whole
# point of the link.
